  "method": "Read-only weekly digest. Per client, metrics are SUM(internal_analytics.daily_analytics_snapshots) over the report week (tenant-wide, all seats). Baseline = trailing 4-week average of each metric. A metric is red-flagged when it moves ≥ 30% in the unhealthy direction (down: sends/replies/positive/meetings/revenue; up: negative/blocked), above a min-volume floor (baseline ≥ 10 sends / ≥ 3 replies), or drops to zero after prior activity. Clients with < 2 baseline weeks render without flags (“new”); weeks with < 7 snapshot-days are noted and flag-suppressed to avoid false churn alerts from an incomplete precalc."
